# Kaya, Spirits' Justice's first ability (CR 603.2, 707.2, 707.9a, 611.2): a creature card in Bot1's graveyard put into exile triggers it.
# Turn 1 the +1 makes a Spirit token; on turn 3 the +2 surveils Hill Giant into the graveyard (Mox Ruby kept on top) and exiles it from there,
# so Bot1 may choose Hill Giant from among the exiled cards and the Spirit token becomes a copy of it, 3/3 red with flying though Hill Giant has
# none, until end of turn (the copy is of the card, not of its name only: its characteristics are the printed ones). At the end step it is a
# 1/1 white and black Spirit again.

[Bot1 Deck]
Kaya, Spirits' Justice
Black Lotus
Mox Pearl
Island x4
Island
Hill Giant
Mox Ruby
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

